# Hy-MT2-1.8B Model Directory

This directory should contain the Hy-MT2-1.8B model files.

## Download

**Transformers format:**
1. Visit https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT2-1.8B
2. Download all files using git-lfs or the "Download" button
3. Place them in this directory

Expected files:
```
hy-mt2-1.8b/
├── config.json
├── tokenizer_config.json
├── tokenizer.model
├── model-00001-of-00002.safetensors
├── model-00002-of-00002.safetensors
└── ...
```

**GGUF format (recommended for CPU):**
1. Visit https://huggingface.co/tencent/Hy-MT2-1.8B-1.25bit-GGUF
2. Download the `.gguf` file
3. Rename and place it here as `hy-mt2-1.8b.gguf`
4. In TMSpeech config, set `--translator-backend gguf` and `--hy-mt2-model hy-mt2-1.8b.gguf`
